    "content": "\n      <h2>Kodaikanal Tour Package from Chennai by Cab – Unwind in the Misty Palani Hills</h2>\n      <p>Perched at an elevation of 2,133 meters in the Western Ghats, Kodaikanal—affectionately known as the \"Princess of Hill Stations\"—is one of the most rejuvenating mountain holidays for Chennai residents. A 510-kilometer road trip takes you from coastal plains through Dindigul into cool eucalyptus groves, misty valleys, and sparkling mountain lakes. Booking a dedicated outstation cab gives you the freedom to admire scenic viewpoints and explore offbeat waterfalls at your own leisure.</p>\n\n      <h2>Kodaikanal Cab Tour Tariff & Vehicle Options</h2>\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse border border-gray-200\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr class=\"bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-semibold text-sm\">\n              <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Vehicle Model</th>\n              <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Capacity</th>\n              <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Luggage Space</th>\n              <th class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">Round Trip Tariff (3 Days / ~1200 km)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100\">\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Swift Dzire / Etios (AC)</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">4 Passengers</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">2 Large Bags</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-semibold text-blue-700\">₹18,500 – ₹20,000</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50\">\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Maruti Ertiga (AC)</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">6 Passengers</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">3–4 Bags</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-semibold text-blue-700\">₹22,500 – ₹24,000</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100\">\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Toyota Innova Crysta</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">7 Passengers</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">4–5 Bags</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-semibold text-blue-700\">₹26,500 – ₹28,500</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"bg-gray-50/50\">\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-medium\">Tempo Traveller</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">12–14 Passengers</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3\">8–10 Bags</td>\n              <td class=\"border border-gray-200 p-3 font-semibold text-blue-700\">₹36,000 – ₹39,000</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>Suggested 3-Day Kodaikanal Itinerary</h2>\n      <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 my-4\">\n        <li><strong>Day 1:</strong> Overnight drive from Chennai, reach Kodaikanal hotel by 9:00 AM, freshen up, visit Silver Cascade Falls and enjoy evening boating at Kodai Lake.</li>\n        <li><strong>Day 2:</strong> Full-day sightseeing including Coaker's Walk, Bryant Park, Pillar Rocks, Green Valley View, Guna Caves, and Pine Forest.</li>\n        <li><strong>Day 3:</strong> Morning shopping for handmade chocolates and eucalyptus oils; check-out and scenic downhill drive back to Chennai.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n      <div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">What is the best time to start the Chennai to Kodaikanal road trip?</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">We recommend departing Chennai between 9:00 PM and 10:00 PM for an overnight drive. This allows you to reach the foothills near Batlagundu by sunrise and climb the scenic ghat road by 8:00 AM, avoiding heavy uphill truck traffic.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">Are your drivers experienced with Kodaikanal ghat road hairpin turns?</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Yes, all our outstation chauffeurs are rigorously vetted and have years of experience navigating the 18+ hairpin curves of the Palani–Ghat Road safely in all weather conditions.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">What major sightseeing spots are covered in the Kodaikanal cab itinerary?</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Our typical 3-day itinerary covers Kodaikanal Lake boating, Coaker’s Walk, Pillar Rocks, Green Valley View, Pine Forest, Guna Caves, and Silver Cascade Falls.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    ",
